{
    "title": "Car Key: Smart Car Remote Lock",
    "description": "The complete Smart Car Key Connected gives you fully control your vehicle and quick track of its location are now available on Google Play. Car Key enhances smart control and safety of your vehicle.\r\n\r\nThe best universal car remote control app - Check your car status, share car access, locate vehicle, navigate and more with Smart Car Key Connected\r\n\r\nYou just need to ensure your vehicle is compatible with this app. Smart Car Key Connected are compatible with 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Ram Trucks, Tesla, Toyota and Volkswagen. The setup details will be shown step-by-step inside the app. Please make sure that you already own the car brand account or must already sign up before connecting.\r\n\r\nCar Key provide many unique features such as:\r\n\r\n1/ Lock and Unlock the car door from wherever you are at ease without delay. It will save your day when you suddenly lose or forget to bring the physical car or smart key with you. You do not need to come close to the door when tap lock or unlock.\r\n\r\n2/ Vehicle status shows you the status of your vehicle real-time including fuel level, battery charge status, odometer, trip mileage and especially receive safety alerts about tire pressure when it goes below average level, which perfectly help you to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.\r\n\r\n3/ Smart Navigation helps you locate your car or find fastest routes to nearby parking lots, gas or EV charging stations.\r\n\r\nSmart Car Key Connected is a powerful tool for car owners, allowing them to monitor vehicle data real-time, manage share car to others, locate car fastest and smart navigation for convenience when traveling. Whether you're a car enthusiast or just looking to stay on top of your vehicle's key remote control, the Smart Car Key Connected is still the #1 app for any car owner.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Subscribed user has unlimited access, auto-renewing subscription. \r\n\u2022 Unsubscribed user can only use free features\r\n\u2022 Users can receive 3 days free trial\r\n\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\u2022 The account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://metaverselabs.ai/terms-of-use/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://metaverselabs.ai/privacy-policy/\r\nYou are welcome to contact us at support@metaverselabs.ai",
    "descriptionHTML": "The complete Smart Car Key Connected gives you fully control your vehicle and quick track of its location are now available on Google Play. Car Key enhances smart control and safety of your vehicle.<br><br>The best universal car remote control app - Check your car status, share car access, locate vehicle, navigate and more with Smart Car Key Connected<br><br>You just need to ensure your vehicle is compatible with this app. Smart Car Key Connected are compatible with 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Ram Trucks, Tesla, Toyota and Volkswagen. The setup details will be shown step-by-step inside the app. Please make sure that you already own the car brand account or must already sign up before connecting.<br><br>Car Key provide many unique features such as:<br><br>1/ Lock and Unlock the car door from wherever you are at ease without delay. It will save your day when you suddenly lose or forget to bring the physical car or smart key with you. You do not need to come close to the door when tap lock or unlock.<br><br>2/ Vehicle status shows you the status of your vehicle real-time including fuel level, battery charge status, odometer, trip mileage and especially receive safety alerts about tire pressure when it goes below average level, which perfectly help you to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.<br><br>3/ Smart Navigation helps you locate your car or find fastest routes to nearby parking lots, gas or EV charging stations.<br><br>Smart Car Key Connected is a powerful tool for car owners, allowing them to monitor vehicle data real-time, manage share car to others, locate car fastest and smart navigation for convenience when traveling. Whether you&#39;re a car enthusiast or just looking to stay on top of your vehicle&#39;s key remote control, the Smart Car Key Connected is still the #1 app for any car owner.<br><br>\u2022 Subscribed user has unlimited access, auto-renewing subscription. <br>\u2022 Unsubscribed user can only use free features<br>\u2022 Users can receive 3 days free trial<br>\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.<br>\u2022 The account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.<br>\u2022 Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://metaverselabs.ai/terms-of-use/<br>Privacy Policy: https://metaverselabs.ai/privacy-policy/<br>You are welcome to contact us at support@metaverselabs.ai",
